{"id": "55103", "title": "10万吨/年热法磷酸项目EPC交钥匙工程总承包（二次）中标候选人公示NEW", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/tradeInfo/detailHtml?metaId=1227156684770775040", "date": "2026-07-03", "source": "贵州公共资源交易中心", "category": "", "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span>根据相关法律法规规章和招标文件的规定，</span></span><span><span><span>10万吨年热法磷酸项目EPC交钥匙工程总承包(二次)</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>E522725202600021V001</span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>已于</span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>06</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span>日在</span></span><span><span><span>黔南州</span></span></span><span><span>公共资源交易中心开标评标。根据评标委员会出具的评标报告，现公示下列内容：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>一、中标候选人信息</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）第一中标候选人</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.基础信息</span></span></p><table class=\"bid-table\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>信息类别</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>具体内容</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）中标候选人名称</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>中蓝连海设计研究院有限公司</span></span><span><span>（联合体成员：中国化学工程第六建设有限公司）</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>2）中标候选人资质</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>化工石化医药行业</span></span><span><span>甲</span></span><span><span>级</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>石油化工工程施工总承包特级</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>3）投标报价</span></span><span><span>（总价</span><span>单价</span></span><span><span>下浮率其他</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>70680000.00</span></span><span><span>元</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>4）质量要求</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1、总体工程质量：设计、设备材料、施工质量必须达到国家或行业合格标准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.1设计质量标准：严格执行国家现行有关法律法规、标准规范(包括但不限于建筑、消防、节能、安全、给排水、环保等法规要求)，满足现行的石油化工企业设计、建筑工程建设标准、设计规范和本招标文件要求的设计深度。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.2设备材料质量标准：工程所有物资（材料、设备、构配件等）采购质量需符合设计、有关标准规范及招标人的要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.3施工质量标准：按要求</span></span><span><span>使用于</span></span><span><span>项目工程的设备、材料满足</span></span><span><span>须</span></span><span><span>相关质量验收标准，施工工艺按照验收规范组织实施，确保施工质量符合《工程施工质量验收规范》及国家规定的相关质量要求。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.4施工进度目标：严格按照合同的工期要求完成工程建设，包括节点工期目标的完成。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.5安全责任目标：确保无伤亡事故发生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.6文明施工目标：对本工程实施全过程的标准化管理，满足有关规范标准要求及发包人安全文明管理规定。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.7安全生产及文明施工要求：</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1)投标人在施工过程中须遵守安全文明施工要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2)投标人在工程实施过程中须加强现场安全管理，杜绝发生一般及以上安全事故。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3)投标人应根据施工现场环境，在施工组织方案中制定防噪音、防尘、防污染以及安全文明施工等措施，相关措施必须符合国家、行业和招标人的管理规定；在施工建设过程中，投标人需根据以上措施制定实施计划及资源投入计划，并针对招标人和监理单位发现的问题进行整改。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(4)投标人应做好相关应急预案，及时高效处置各种突发事件，招标人参与的管理核查不能降低投标人应承担的责任。</span></span></p><p><span><span>(5)项目工程质保期内返工产生的协调事项及费用由投标人承担。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、其他要求：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.1如中标，将配合招标人办理本项目涉及的一切行政许可手续（法律法规规定由投标人办理的由投标人自行办理）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.2投标人须负责保持施工区和生活区的环境卫生，定时清除垃圾，并将其运至批准的地点。投标人须在现场和生活区设置足够的临时卫生设施，定期清扫处理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.3保证本项目招标范围的工程内容按国家规程、规范及本文中要求验收合格，并负责按规定在质保期内履行保修任务。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.4 投标人须配合招标人完成项目</span></span><span><span>转固。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>工程竣工验收合格后，投标人应根据档案管理部门的要求在规定的期限内完成本工程档案备案、竣工结算等工作，同时办理工程移交手续。</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>5）安全目标</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>满足招标文件要求。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>6）工期服务期供货期（日历天）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>计划工期：</span></span><span><span>304日历天 ，其中2026年12月31日热法磷酸装置主厂房封顶，2027年1月31日具备全厂单机试车条件，2027年3月31日具备投料试车条件，2027年6月30日完工。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>招标文件载明的计划工期日历天数，与自中标通知书下发之日起核算的各分项阶段工期不一致，项目工期考核均以各阶段既定时间节点完成要求为执行标准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>工期计算开始日期：以中标通知书发出之日为工期计算起始日。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>（</span><span>7）评审得分</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span><span>合计得分：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>.6</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>2.评标委员会各成员打分情况表：</span></span></p><table class=\"bid-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><strong><span><span>评标委员会评审内容</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span><span>1</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>2</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>3</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>4</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>5</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>7</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>8</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>成员</span></span><span><span>9</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>总承包管理方案及设计组织</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>总承包管理方案</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5分</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.60</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.20</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.20</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.60</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.80</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>设计组织</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5分</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.20</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.30</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.20</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.60</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.20</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4.80</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span><span><span>施工组织设计及采购方案（</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>施工组织设计总体概述（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>分）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.70</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.60</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2.80</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>施工工期、</span></span><span><span>施工质量、</span></span><span><span>施工进度计划及保证措施（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>分）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.40</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.40</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.60</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3.80</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>农民工工资支付保障措施</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2分</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.70</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.80</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.50</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.70</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.90</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1.70</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>", "html": "", "method": "中标候选人", "region": "贵州", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [], "hasAttachment": false, "is_bidding": true}